# World Watchout runs with no environment variables; everything below is optional.
# WW_MOCK=1   serves deterministic sample headlines and quotes from src/lib/mock.ts instead of live feeds, and a sample brief from /api/brief (offline UI work, screenshots).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...   enables the AI brief (POST /api/brief, model claude-opus-5); without it the Intel view returns a sample brief and says so.
